Third-party software in JAI Studio
==================================

JAI Studio contains the open-source packages listed below. For each licence
it names the packages under it, then gives the licence text with their
copyright notices. The models and engines that JAI Studio downloads are not
part of it; they keep their own licences, which the Models tab and
`jai models status` show.

